  "body": "## What changed\n- Added `fidelity_law::band_growth(excess)` so measured standoffs grow by `excess` while `GOUGE_TOL` stays positive and return `0.0` past that bound.\n- Allowed cross drill (`OpParams::Drill { cross, .. }`) in `fidelity_law::excess_aware`.\n- Grew `cross_stock::standoff` radii and Z tops by `band_growth(excess)`.\n- Expanded `cross_entry::tube_max` facet slabs along normals by `s + grow` for `entry_grown` and `tube_reach`.\n- Added `part_grow` to `drill_reach::cross_reach` when `st.raw` is `None`.\n- Grew `drill_station::material`, `drill_reach::cross_holder_excess`, and `band_clear` Z bands and radii by `band_growth(excess)`.\n- Tightened `cross_part::part_clear`, `neighbours_clear`, and `met_at` with `tightened(GOUGE_TOL, excess)` from both `cross_spindle` and `kept_rejudge`.\n- Tightened `camcraft_sim::verify::rapids_radial::radial_rapids` with `band_growth()` on `stock_top_z` and `tightened(...)` on disc radius.\n- Recorded the design choice in `docs/decisions/1053-fidelity-cross-drill.md`.\n\n## Cause\nPR #1081 lifted probe and plasma on coarse models, leaving cross drill refused because its construction laws (`cross_stock`, `cross_entry`, `drill_reach`, `drill_station`), solid law (`cross_part`), and radial rapid law (`rapids_radial`) did not account for model excess.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins: added 6 tests in `crates/app/tests/coarse_cross_drill.rs` and `a_radial_rapid_grazing_a_coarse_bar_inside_the_excess_is_convicted_only_on_a_coarse_model` in `crates/sim/tests/coarse_collision.rs`. Every pin failed before the fix and passes after it.\n- Mutation checks: reverted each new guard independently (`rapids_radial`, `fidelity_law::excess_aware`, `cross_stock::standoff`, `cross_entry::tube_max`, `drill_reach::cross_reach`, `drill_station::material`, `cross_part::law`). Each corresponding pin failed with its guard reverted and passed when restored.\n- Gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed (sim 43s, app 2335s, ui 371s; 0 failed). `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-sim --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed cleanly.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone. `git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n- The `kept_rejudge` live re-judge path and the swing branch of `drill_reach::band_clear` were updated consistently with `cross_spindle` and `station`, and compile and clippy-check cleanly, but have no separate coarse-model pin of their own.\n\n## Overlaps\nPR #1713 and PR #468 touch `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs` in different match arms (`Finish3D` and `Threading`); whichever merges second refreshes.\n\nChangelog: Allow cross drill on reduced-fidelity models by tightening standoffs, entries, reach, holder clearance, part checks, and radial rapids by the model excess.\n\nFixes #1053\n",
